          "result-4"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "After a week of deadly high water, an unprecedented weather event strained critical infrastructure pushed to its engineered limits. The nation's legitimate authority directed a military evacuation operation, deploying the state's crisis-response force. This action was part of a broader effort to restore order, culminating in a presidential visit to the affected area to oversee the response and coordinate with a neighboring country on a water management agreement for flood mitigation.",
